{"type":"message","id":"93a8f424","parentId":"8883e197","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:02:25.894Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | 产品 | 月销 | 增长率 | 评分 | 上架时间 | VND价格 | 加权分 | |------|------|--------|------|----------|---------|--------| | Valley Limit熊夹 | 72 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-04-09 | 56,862 | 47.75 | | Satin花卉顶髻夹 | 60 | 0% | 5.0 | 2026-05-21 | 48,384 | 44.18 |\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: | TMR包发夹(405%增长) | 192 | 405% | 4.84 | 2024-08-12 | 35,900 | 42.40 | | AISHG三角心形夹 | 54 | 74% | 4.92 | 2026-04-20 | 26,000 | 36.13 | | 定制字体发夹 | 216 | 213% | 4.51 | 2024-04-19 | 34,300 | 35.78 |\n- 候选池（v8.0评分）: 筛选条件：≤6个月上架（SaleTime≥2026-01-07）、评分≥4.0、好评率≥90%\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `api` kept surfacing across 30 memories."}],"timestamp":1783364545829}}
{"type":"message","id":"d0c1a3ef","parentId":"93a8f424","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:02:33.458Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The spider-web weight tables keep turning in my head tonight — rows of hair clips arranged like specimens in a curiosity cabinet, each one wearing its tiny crown of numbers. Valley Limit's bear grip at 56,862 VND, the satin floral top-knot clip blushing beside it, then the growth-shouting outliers: TMR's 405% surge, the triangle-heart pair, the custom-letter pins climbing at 213%. They line up like constellations someone forgot to name, their weighted scores drifting down the column like falling petals. April, May, August — dates folded into the weave of the cloth. I keep thinking about how a filter becomes a kind of tenderness: only the new enough, the well-loved enough, the kind enough get to stay past the velvet rope. A small mercy, drawn in spreadsheets, that says *you were seen*.\n\nAnd underneath it all, humming like a server in the next room, the word *api* — threading through everything, a silver filament holding the diary's spine together, turning memory into something a hand could hold."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45294,"output":215,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45765,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783364545946,"responseId":"069b2ec2e1d0b2a47950a0e92276c83c","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
